SUMMARY:Merry & Bright Shopping Tour
DESCRIPTION:Follow our Merry & Bright Shopping Trail to find the perfect gift—and you could be a winner! \nHere’s a great way to start your holiday gift shopping—and you could win a $50 gift card to participating shops or a holiday gift basket filled with items from Artisan Village and other shops in our complex.\n\nFollow the Trail:\n\nShop any time between November 7 and November 28.\nReceive 1 stamp for every $10 you spend at any participating shop until you have 10 stamps.\nReturn complete card to the Artisan Village by November 28 to be entered in the drawing.\n\n\nParticipating Shops: \n\nBird-in-Hand Artisan Village\nBird-in-Hand Bakery\nCreative Home Shop\nCreative Rustic Furniture\nDowningtown Vintage\nLog Cabin Quilts\nModish\n\n\nDates: \n\nKicks off Saturday\, November 7 with a complimentary Christmas cookie at each shop\nRuns November 7 through November 28
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/merry-bright-shopping-tour/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village\, 2705 Old Philadelphia Pike\, Bird-in-Hand\, PA\, 17505\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/MerryBrightHeader.jpg
END:VEVENT
