SUMMARY:Thanksgiving Grand Smorgasbord
DESCRIPTION:November 26 from 11 am – 6 pm \n  \nEnjoy a delicious Thanksgiving meal featuring: \nFresh roast turkey with gravy • Hickory smoked ham • Ham balls \nStrip loin • Roast beef • Baked fish •  Pecan crusted tilapia \nHomemade soups • Salad bar • Cranberry relish \nPennsylvania Dutch bread filling • Real mashed potatoes • Candied sweet potatoes \nGreen bean casserole • Citrus glazed carrots • Corn & other vegetables \nBeverage • Full dessert bar including Grandma Smucker’s pumpkin pie \n  \nPricing: \n\nAdult $43.95\nKids (8-12) $19.95\nKids (4-7) $15.95\n\nReservations open Monday\, September 28.  Reservations are required – call (717) 768-1100.  For groups of 9 or more\, call (717) 768-1551.
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/62798/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Family Restaurant & Smorgasbord\, 2760 Old Philadelphia Pike\, Bird-in-Hand\, PA\, 17505\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/TurkeyPlatter-1680x896.jpg
