SUMMARY:Santa's Mail Drop
DESCRIPTION:Santa Claus is comin’ to town—so make sure he has your holiday wish list! \nFor express delivery to the North Pole\, look for Santa’s Mail Drop inside our Bakery & Cafe and Artisan Village\, from November 27 through December 12. \nBe sure to include your return address for a special reply! \n  \nBird-in-Hand Bakery & Cafe: Mon. – Sat.\, 6 a.m. – 5:30 p.m. \nBird-in-Hand Artisan Village: Mon. – Sat.\, 9 a.m. – 5 p.m.
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/santas-mail-drop-4/
