SUMMARY:Black Friday at Bird-in-Hand
DESCRIPTION:Brighten your day by stopping to shop at Artisan Village \nWhy fight the crowded parking lots and long register lines at the big box stores just to buy more of the same old\, same old? And why take a chance shopping online for items whose quality you can’t see for yourself? And will they arrive in time for holiday gift giving? \nShop for unique\, handcrafted merchandise from dozens of local vendors working in ceramic\, wood\, leather\, wool and other media. You’ll find one-of-a kind jewelry\, heirloom quality furniture and toys\, fashion accessories\, housewares and home décor\, and much more\, as well as a selection of locally produced gourmet treats that make welcome hostess gifts. \nMake a day of it\, with lunch at our Bakery & Cafe next door. And just footsteps away\, continue your shopping spree at Modish Lancaster\, Creative Rustic Furniture\, Downingtown Vintage at Bird-in-Hand and Fisher’s Quilts. \nDate: Friday\, November 27 \nTime: 9 a.m. – 5 p.m.
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/black-friday-at-bird-in-hand/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village\, 2705 Old Philadelphia Pike\, Bird-in-Hand\, PA\, 17505\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/BlackFriday.jpg
END:VEVENT
