SUMMARY:Small Business Saturday
DESCRIPTION:Small Business Saturday is a great day to shop Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village \nFor more than a decade\, Small Business Saturday has celebrated small businesses and their contributions to their communities. At Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village\, we celebrate entrepreneurship every day\, but this year on Small Business Saturday\, we’re doing something special. \nMeet the makers\, sample local food products and shop our carefully curated collection of locally made merchandise\, including one-of-a kind jewelry\, heirloom quality furniture and toys\, fashion accessories\, housewares and home décor\, and much more\, as well as a selection of locally produced gourmet treats that make welcome hostess gifts. \nYou can also enter to win a $50 Artisan Village gift certificate. \nIt’s shopping you can feel good about! \nDate: Saturday\, November 28 \nTime: 9 a.m. – 5 p.m.
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/small-business-saturday/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village\, 2705 Old Philadelphia Pike\, Bird-in-Hand\, PA\, 17505\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/SmallBusinessSaturdayHeader.jpg
END:VEVENT
