SUMMARY:Girls' Night Out
DESCRIPTION:Gather your gal pals and enjoy an evening at Artisan Village \nHow’s this for holiday fun? Bond with your girlfriends as you buy unique\, locally handcrafted gifts for everyone on your list. Our Girls’ Night Out event at Artisan Village turns Christmas shopping into a special evening. \nWe’ll have gift bags for the first 25 ladies through the door after 5 p.m.—and we’ll offer extended shopping hours until 8 p.m. In between you can sip mocktails and enjoy light refreshments while you browse our carefully curated selection of merchandise from dozens of local vendors and take advantage of discounts throughout the store. You’ll also play Christmas Bingo and you could win one of many locally handcrafted gifts from our Artisans. \nMake the most of your visit. Before you shop\, grab a late lunch or light supper at the Bird-in-Hand Bakery & Cafe adjacent to Artisan Village. We’ll be serving handcrafted sandwiches on artisan bread\, homemade soups and fresh salads until 5:30 p.m. Or stop in our Bird-in-Hand Family Restaurant & Smorgasbord and enjoy classic Pennsylvania Dutch dishes and other delicious favorites from our grand buffet. \n\nDate: Thursday\, December 10\nTime: 5 p.m. to 8 p.m.
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/girls-night-out-3/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village\, 2705 Old Philadelphia Pike\, Bird-in-Hand\, PA\, 17505\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/AVGirlsShoppingWEB.jpg
END:VEVENT
